# The Azure Pipelines task dist/ is not committed (it ships inside the VSIX),
# but its dependency manifests are: release builds restore the VSIX runtime
# dependency tree reproducibly with `npm ci` (Scripts/bundle.mjs --frozen),
# which validates the committed package.json/package-lock.json pair.
!packages/azdo-task/dist/
packages/azdo-task/dist/**
!packages/azdo-task/dist/package.json
!packages/azdo-task/dist/package-lock.json
